
	
				Purchasing 4D-BBS



If you wish to purchase 4D-BBS, please send your mailing address and $49.95
in the form of check or money order (made payable to Cornerstone  Software)
to one of the below adresses.

Upon  receiving  your  order,  you will  be  mailed  one  3.5 inch diskette
containing a bootable,  full-working  version of  4D-BBS and a registration
form.  The manual will also  accompany the diskette  in hard copy form, but
is also on the diskette itself.

It is important that once you receive your copy of 4D-BBS, the registration
form should  be filled out.  This will give you  access to FREE  updates of
4D-BBS, which are available for downloading from the 4D-BBS support library
on both 4D-BBS support bulletin boards.

For more information call the 4D-BBS support bulletin boards at:

 The Grave Yard - CS  509-924-3253    14400 V.32bis / ZyXEL 19.2k  
 Spokane, WA          509-924-3288    14400 V.32bis / ZyXEL 16.8k
 
